[{"client_msg_id":"ff84f33e-73dd-47e9-bb30-50aad29f1144","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私もτは上をニョロっとさせて区別しますね。こういうのって習うわけでもないのに結構皆同じように書くんですね。不思議","ts":"1618497334.058500","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1618497344.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qqeRP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5a2f8bc8-72a1-4694-99b7-497e50bac70b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"∫f(τ)g(t-τ)dτ とかですよね。分かる〜私の分野もまさにそれです。","ts":"1618497262.057900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z/T2P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"953b30ca-f45a-41a9-a916-bb39b9ff8922","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"量子力学をするので、 φ と ψ の書き分けには細心の注意を払う","ts":"1618495655.056700","edited":{"user":"U01ATUT6PL3","ts":"1618495666.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Rq5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ff773a16-f5f9-4b85-ba9a-4347c14d37eb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"丁字路と時刻tと時間要素τって書かれたら読み分けられる自信がないな","ts":"1618493696.056200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"r5jtl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d58ca16d-0da8-4c7e-b002-641e613627c0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"tとτが両方時刻に出てくるのは分かりすぎる\n時間領域のconvolutionとかみんなそう書くし…","ts":"1618493590.055500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RckyW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"755374c4-8c44-4fd1-83cd-dfc9c7f8c083","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"γは下をくっつけずにループを作ることで区別してます","ts":"1618493527.055300","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1618493533.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LuM4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9375d81e-8e49-4ea3-8b23-1860b268cc4a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"τは上を~っぽくしてますね","ts":"1618493435.055100","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1618493442.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"w9n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc5a8d02-6d6c-4182-953f-3c171eb01ae5","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"r と γ とか t と τ とか、手書きだと気を遣いますよね\n特に t と τ は縦棒がちょっと突き出るとほぼ見分けがつかなくなる上に、（私の分野だと）どちらも時刻を表す変数として用いられるので文脈からも判断しづらいという辛さがある","ts":"1618491602.055000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"27cI"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u003c@UFHQ7TNT0\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618491016.053300","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"906093f5-ce29-48c3-8034-8309fecd6a9c","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"今年から取り組みだした分野はx（エックス）とχ（カイ）を両方かなり使うんですが、小文字エックスをχっぽく派の人間だったので困っている","ts":"1618490726.053100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n2P"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U017BU3UZBQ","text":"\u003c@U017BU3UZBQ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1618490505.052900","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"61a5e671-e48f-46ac-979d-5b60c844c008","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"\u003chttps://www.miz.nao.ac.jp/eht-j/c/pr/pr20210414\u003e","ts":"1618446284.052700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zP32U"}]}]
